<title>USA: Mid-America Bancorp lifts dividend to $0.19.</title>
<headline>Mid-America Bancorp lifts dividend to $0.19.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, KY. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mid-America Bancorp said Monday it raised its regular quarterly cash dividend to $0.19 a share from $0.165.</p>
<p>The dividend, which represents a 15 percent increase over the last three regular cash dividends in 1996, will be payable on March 7 to shareholders of record as of February 21, the company said.</p>
